# Career Integrity

## Claims

Every résumé bullet, message, or case statement must show: assertion → evidence → source → confidence → overclaim risk.

Forbidden without proof: “em produção”, “alta escala”, “IA” for deterministic rules, “sênior”, fake % lifts, unverified “usuários/clientes”.

## Positioning

- Prefer **estágio** as primary experience level; júnior acceptable on individual apps.
- Career tracks (Full-Stack, Data, Front, Back, AI careful, Mobile) — do not force a single identity.
- Distinguish: missing skill vs evidence not registered vs equivalent tech vs optional requirement.

## Human in the loop

No auto-apply, auto-send networking, or silent résumé finalization. AI assists; Felipe approves outbound actions.
